@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Working Directory" as WD
rectangle "Staging Area" as SA
rectangle ".git\n(Repository)" as REPO

note bottom of WD
modified
or
untracked
end note

note bottom of SA
staged
(ready for commit)
end note

note bottom of REPO
committed
(versioned)
end note

WD --> SA : git add
SA --> REPO : git commit

@enduml